---
import CompanyCarousel from './CompanyCarousel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">
        <h2>About</h2>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>I'm Tabrez</strong>, a Full Stack Developer with a passion for building software that solves real problems.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">I thrive on tackling complex challenges and turning them into clean, practical solutions - whether that's architecting a system from scratch or jumping into an existing codebase and making it better.  I care about code that's reliable, scales when it needs to, and remains easy to maintain.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">I bring both technical depth and clear communication to every project - I can talk tech with engineers or break it down clearly for non-technical stakeholders.  Either way, I'm easy to work with and always happy to collaborate on something new.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Got an interesting project?  I'd love to hear about it.</strong></p>
            <CompanyCarousel />
            <p class="mb-4">Some of the projects I've worked on include:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>A social platform for musicians to showcase their instruments and gear (<a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.rifftales.net">Rifftales</a>).</li>
                <li>An Electronic Document Management System (EDMS) for the NHS (<a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="http://www.mizaic.com">Mizaic</a>).</li>
                <li>A community engagement platform allowing residents to provide feedback on local developments (<a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="http://www.commonplace.is">Commonplace</a>).</li>
                <li>A platform for data scientists to manage and run simulations (Sandtable).</li>
                <li>Family history software helping genealogists build and research their family trees (<a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.findmypast.co.uk/">Findmypast</a>).</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-4">My experience spans the full stack - from designing databases and building backend APIs to developing modern front-ends using technologies such as TypeScript, React, and Tailwind.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>